# HuntTrackPipe - Current State (2026-10-11)

## Done: steps 1-4 of 5
- **Step 1 (core + CLI)**: config, naming, session store, Jev client/questions/derive, schema builder, Claude client, post-processing, Excel writer (`backend/excel/tracker.py`), `backend/pipeline.py` (`extract()`, `create_application()`), CLI `python -m backend.run`. Column lists / dropdown options / `META` live in `backend/columns.py`.
- **Step 2 (webapp)**: FastAPI `backend/main.py` + `backend/api/` on :8010; Vue 3 / Vite 7 / Pinia / Tailwind v4 in `frontend/` on :5180 (`strictPort`, `/api` proxy). Root `npm run dev` runs both. Screens: `DashboardView`, `NewApplicationView`, `SessionView` (tabs overview / files / questions / log), `ConvertView`.
- **Step 3 (files)**: `backend/files/` (`convert.py`, `combine.py`, `manager.py` = `FileManager`), router `routers/files.py`, UI `components/FilesPanel.vue` + `/convert`. soffice uses persistent profile `%TEMP%/htp_lo_profile`; caches `<folder>/.converted/`, `.thumbs/`. Libs in resumate_env: pypdf, img2pdf, pdf2docx (+opencv-headless), pillow, pymupdf, python-multipart.
- **Step 4 (Q&A)**: `backend/qa/answer.py` (`load_candidate_context` -> `CandidateContextMissing` (412); `answer_questions(session, cfg, client, ids=, feedback=, organization=, title=)` one structured call with id enum, dash/quote cleanup, limit verification, one re-ask for offenders, `question.note` if still over; `render_answers_md` / `write_answers_md`). Prompt `QA_SYSTEM` in `llm/prompts.py`. Router `routers/qa.py` (`/sessions/{f}/qa`: GET; POST questions; PUT questions/order; PUT|DELETE questions/{qid}; POST answer; POST regenerate/{qid}) rewrites `answers.md` on every change. UI `components/QaPanel.vue` (add one/many, limits, inline edit, manual answer save, Answer pending/one, Regenerate with feedback, Copy, reorder, counters, missing-context banner). `Question` has `note`, `created_at`; `QA` has `usage`, `last_answered_at`.
- Errors: TrackerLocked 423, TrackerError/ValueError/ConversionError 400, FileNotFoundError 404, CandidateContextMissing 412, upload > 50 MB 413, Jev/LLM 502, FileExistsError 409.
- `review.pending_write` is `{values, force_columns}`; set only on 423, flushed by `/row/retry`.
- Verified in the Cursor browser against a temp tracker copy: extraction, create, edit/save, lock -> 423 -> retry; files (upload, thumbnails incl. DOCX, reorder, finals, combine, convert, standalone convert); Q&A live with Haiku (2 questions in one call within limits, regenerate with feedback, answers.md, 412 when context missing). `vue-tsc --noEmit` passes.
- Still no committed test suite; offline tests run from `%TEMP%`. Add `tests/` in step 5.

